MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Visual overhaul from low-poly to Stylized Realistic Vietnamese street life.

- Warm Vietnamese color palette (golden yellow, terracotta, aged cream)
- Procedural weathering shaders (rain streaks, dampness, moss)
- Vietnamese color grading post-processing pipeline
- Multi-part motorbike, car, bicycle, cyclo traffic
- Night market with food stalls, steam particles, lantern glow
- Seasonal decorations (Tet: mai/dao/cau doi, Trung Thu: lanterns/moon)
- Enhanced water with moonpath, caustics, shore foam
- Sky with cumulus+cirrus clouds, atmospheric haze
- Buildings with tangled wires, potted plants, water tanks
- Fireworks with Tet mode (red/gold), willow sparks

Tests: 298/298 pass, build OK
